WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.850
In 921 the Sajid general Beshir
marched on Lake Sevan,

2
00:00:06.890 --> 00:00:12.511
where King Ashot II, the Iron King,
had withdrawn to the island.

3
00:00:12.551 --> 00:00:16.010
The king put seventy
of his best archers into boats.

4
00:00:16.050 --> 00:00:19.144
Their arrows drove
Beshir's host from the shore.

5
00:00:19.384 --> 00:00:23.634
Ashot died in 929
still master of his kingdom.

6
00:00:23.874 --> 00:00:26.866
String the bows, launch the boats.

